{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "textDocument/didOpen", "params": {"textDocument": {"uri": "file://tests/fixtures/lsp_ws/hover_stdlib_docs/app.z", "version": 1, "languageId": "zerolang", "text": "# Hover over the STDLIB surface the documentation arc filled in: a union ARM,\n# an OPERATOR, a CONVERSION and a container MEMBER. Before the arc each\n# answered with a bare signature and nothing else.\n#\n# The operator is the one that needed language-server work as well. An operator\n# IS a method here, and the method it resolves to is stamped against the BINOP,\n# so a span row keyed by the operator's own atom resolved to nothing at all.\n# The row carries the binop's node id instead.\n\nmain: function is {\n    e: io.IoError.notfound\n    match (\n        e\n    ) case notfound then {\n        print \"missing\"\n    } else {\n        print \"other\"\n    }\n    b: 255.u8\n    one: 1.u8\n    s: b + one\n    w: b.i16\n    xs: (List String)\n    n: xs.length\n    print \"\\{s} \\{w} \\{n}\"\n}\n"}}}
